{
  "id": "80688",
  "type": "Page",
  "tags": [],
  "title": "pH and pOH",
  "content": {
    "bibrefs": [],
    "model": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Hydronium and hydroxide ions are present both in pure water and in all aqueous solutions, and their concentrations are inversely proportional, as shown by the ion product of water ("
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "K"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "w"
              },
              {
                "text": "). The concentrations of these ions in a solution are often critical determinants of the solution’s properties and of the chemical behaviors of its other solutes. Chemists have developed a specific vocabulary to describe these concentrations in relative terms: "
              }
            ],
            "id": "owm5cbs08pgnxyf",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "A solution is "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "neutral"
                          }
                        ],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "text": "Describes a solution in which [H"
                              },
                              {
                                "sub": true,
                                "text": "3"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "O"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "+"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "] = [OH"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "−"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "3756722441",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "3355670047",
                        "trigger": "hover",
                        "type": "popup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " if it contains equal concentrations of hydronium and hydroxide ions"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "text": "Describes a solution in which [H"
                              },
                              {
                                "sub": true,
                                "text": "3"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "O"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "+"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "] > [OH"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "−"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "1463937190",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "4269943629",
                        "trigger": "hover",
                        "type": "popup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": ". "
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "r0wdbs3kq8id88z",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2764459665",
                "type": "li"
              }
            ],
            "id": "2897588683",
            "type": "ul"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "A solution is "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "acidic"
                          }
                        ],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "text": "Describes a solution in which [H"
                              },
                              {
                                "sub": true,
                                "text": "3"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "O"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "+"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "] > [OH"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "−"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "1463937190",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "4269943629",
                        "trigger": "hover",
                        "type": "popup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " if it contains a greater concentration of hydronium ions than hydroxide ions"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "text": "Describes a solution in which [H"
                              },
                              {
                                "sub": true,
                                "text": "3"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "O"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "+"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "] < [OH"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "−"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "219857354",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "3906112094",
                        "trigger": "hover",
                        "type": "popup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": ". "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "text": "Describes a solution in which [H"
                              },
                              {
                                "sub": true,
                                "text": "3"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "O"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "+"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "] < [OH"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "−"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "219857354",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "3906112094",
                        "trigger": "hover",
                        "type": "popup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "49banoeozu1v143",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3823617092",
                "type": "li"
              }
            ],
            "id": "2083992103",
            "type": "ul"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "A solution is "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "basic"
                          }
                        ],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "text": "Describes a solution in which [H"
                              },
                              {
                                "sub": true,
                                "text": "3"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "O"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "+"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "] < [OH"
                              },
                              {
                                "sup": true,
                                "text": "−"
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "219857354",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "3906112094",
                        "trigger": "hover",
                        "type": "popup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " if it contains a lesser concentration of hydronium ions than hydroxide ions."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "czj0e0kwli49b0d",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3633433305",
                "type": "li"
              }
            ],
            "id": "2618470335",
            "type": "ul"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Hydronium and hydroxide ion concentrations can have a huge range of values, from less than 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−15"
              },
              {
                "text": " M to greater than 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−15"
              },
              {
                "text": " M. A common means of expressing quantities that span many orders of magnitude is to use logarithmic scale. For concentrations and equilibrium constants, chemists use the p-function, where X is the quantity of interest and log is the base-10 logarithm:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "8z3xqgdssf2q4cl",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "3cn7jd35mvfh26z",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "jk1lxej55zkp4rs",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "\\mathrm{pX}\\;=\\;-\\log\\,\\mathrm X",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The pH of a solution is defined in terms of the molar concentration of hydronium ion in the solution:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "tumnj7kjnx58ok5",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "sf5h8atg9uhtpjv",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "qwhxnnikzrq2noa",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "\\mathrm{pH}\\;=\\;-\\log\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_3\\mathrm O^+\\rbrack",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The hydroxide ion molarity is expressed in a similar manner:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "6dbf1xv2pwzdc3b",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "p5uwbzgf05tu44f",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "li7mqrgebl4c7pa",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "\\mathrm{pOH}\\;\\;=-\\log\\lbrack\\mathrm{OH}^-\\rbrack",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The relationship between these two ion concentrations expressed as logarithmic functions is derived from the "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "K"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "w"
              },
              {
                "text": " expression:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "hvsvwivzwy0jpsp",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "4q8tnurwd114hfw",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "b98cf6pdk552xw4",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "K_{\\mathrm w}\\;=\\;\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_3\\mathrm O^+\\rbrack\\lbrack\\mathrm{OH}^-\\rbrack",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Taking the base-10 log of both sides and using the properties of logarithms gives:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "kq7fvwx58gb9yeb",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "sssk6sc3qqu4z9v",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "etdjxwl5fxngsyo",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "-\\log\\,K_{\\mathrm w}\\;=\\;-\\log(\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_3\\mathrm O^+\\rbrack\\lbrack\\mathrm{OH}^-\\rbrack)\\; =(-\\log\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_3\\mathrm O^+\\rbrack)+\\;(-\\log\\lbrack\\mathrm{OH}^-\\rbrack)",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Expressing "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "K"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "w"
              },
              {
                "text": " in logarithmic form as, we did with [H"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "3"
              },
              {
                "text": "O"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "+"
              },
              {
                "text": "] and [OH"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−"
              },
              {
                "text": "] gives:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "sbw1pc0kgb1yzca",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "mp615njllypnji7",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "xxg3tb8p8wa2w5r",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "\\mathrm pK_{\\mathrm w}\\;=\\;\\mathrm{pH}\\;+\\;\\mathrm{pOH}",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "At 25 °C, the value of "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "K"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "w"
              },
              {
                "text": " is 1.0 × 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−14"
              },
              {
                "text": ", so:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "yz8y4c9ou2om1w3",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "w6i9mi4xvcvntmd",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "40pi5y12kz2tqzq",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "14.00\\;=\\;\\mathrm{pH}\\;+\\;\\mathrm{pOH}",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "As was shown previously, the hydronium ion molarity in pure water (or in any neutral solution) is 1.0 × 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−7"
              },
              {
                "text": " M at 25 °C. The "
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "pH"
                  }
                ],
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "The negative logarithm (base 10) of the hydronium ion concentration in aqueous solution."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "4198186167",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1180023121",
                "trigger": "hover",
                "type": "popup"
              },
              {
                "text": " and "
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "pOH"
                  }
                ],
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "The negative logarithm (base 10) of the hydroxide ion concentration in aqueous solution."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "960929092",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2359736135",
                "trigger": "hover",
                "type": "popup"
              },
              {
                "text": " of a neutral solution at this temperature are therefore:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "o0bxnvcfy20xwe6",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "pb2pxg0le8gmbqi",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "8olz0w1r7t2binn",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{pH}\\;=\\;-\\log\\lbrack\\mathrm H^+\\rbrack\\;=\\;-\\log(1.0\\times10^{-7})\\;=\\;7.00\\;\\;\\;\\\\\\;\\mathrm{pOH}\\;=\\;-\\log\\lbrack\\mathrm{OH}^-\\rbrack\\;=\\;-\\log(1.0\\times10^{-7})\\;=\\;7.00\\end{array}",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "At 25 °C, acidic solutions are those with hydronium ion molarities greater than 1.0 × 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−7"
              },
              {
                "text": " M and hydroxide ion molarities less than 1.0 × 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−7"
              },
              {
                "text": " M (corresponding to pH values less than 7.00 and pOH values greater than 7.00). Basic solutions are those with hydronium ion molarities less than 1.0 × 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−7"
              },
              {
                "text": " M and hydroxide ion molarities greater than 1.0 × 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−7"
              },
              {
                "text": " M (corresponding to pH values greater than 7.00 and pOH values less than 7.00)."
              }
            ],
            "id": "g9cke6gffn9vmde",
            "type": "p"
          }
        ],
        "id": "3057476928",
